#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = tīras malas spēles renderēšanas izmērā. DLSS = tas pats, un palielina attēlu, ja spēles "
"Scaling ir zem 100 %. off = pašas spēles attēls: salīdzināšanai. Saglabājas uzreiz."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Profili jūsu GPU. augsts = viss ieslēgts (modelis 1). vidējs = modelis 2, uz pusi mazāks "
"caurspīdīguma dziļums, plakani spoguļi bez daļu kustības, vieglāka kustības meklēšana. zems = arī "
"bez spoguļu DLAA, bez caurspīdīguma dziļuma, VR zona 60 %. Nemaina to, ko iestatījāt paši."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = visvairāk detaļu, asākais teksts, apmēram 1,6x GPU slodzes nekā 2. 2 (E) = līdzsvarots, "
"vismazāk rēgu aiz satiksmes: sāciet ar to. 3 (F) = mierīgākais uz žogiem un vadiem, var izsmērēt "
"kustīgas detaļas, cena kā 2. 4 (M) = smagākais (apmēram 5x), tikai plakanam režīmam."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Attēla kvalitāte: asināšana, tekstūru asums, DLAA zona un caurspīdīguma dziļums. Pa labi atver "
"grupu, pa kreisi aizver; atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Asina attēlu pēc DLAA, no 0 (izslēgts) līdz 1.0. Palieliniet, ja attēls mīksts; pārāk liela "
"vērtība dod gaišus oreolus malās. Maksā apmēram 0,1 ms; 0 izlaiž soli."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Cik tālu sniedzas asināšana, no 1 līdz 4 px: mazs = smalkas detaļas, liels = rupjākas malas. "
"Mainiet, ja asināšana par smalku vai rupju; attēlam, kas zīmēts lielāks par ekrānu, kā VR, vajag "
"vairāk nekā 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Asāks tekstūru teksts (ceļa zīmes, instrumentu panelis, GPS). 0 = izslēgts; jo negatīvāks, jo "
"asāks, bet žogi vairāk mirgo; ja teksts izplūdis, mēģiniet no -0.5 līdz -1. Neprasa GPU laiku, "
"tikai nedaudz atmiņas joslas platuma."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"Tas pats tīkla žogiem, zālei un lapu izgriezumiem: palieliniet uz 0 pusi, ja žogi mirgo, "
"samaziniet, ja zāle mīksta. same = seko augstākai rindai. Darbojas tikai, kad Texture sharpness "
"nav 0. Neprasa GPU laiku, nedaudz atmiņas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: DLAA saņem tikai katras acs vidus (20 - 100 %); mala paliek spēles attēls. Samaziniet, lai "
"atļautos smagāku modeli vai vairāk FPS; 40 % maksā apmēram 40 % no modeļa. Iestata arī garāžas / "
"galvenās izvēlnes kravas auto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Tikai plakans: DLAA pirms spēles bloom / tonemap, tāpēc ceļa marķējums, vadi un sliedes mirgo "
"mazāk. Mainiet tikai salīdzināšanai. Netiek lietots ar DLSS palielināšanu vai Windows HDR. Tā "
"pati cena; pārslēgšana aizņem ~60 kadrus."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Dod vadiem, žogiem un stiklam savu attālumu, nevis to, kas aiz tiem, lai kustoties tie "
"neizsmērētos. Izslēdziet, ja smērēšanos neredzat: ietaupa 0,02 - 0,06 ms uz aci."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Neļauj ielas lukturu un auto gaismu mirdzumam atstāt pēdas kustoties: DLSS ņem mirdzumu no "
"pašreizējā kadra, nevis vēstures. 25 % soļos; samaziniet, ja lukturu mirdzums mirgo, 0 = "
"izslēgts. Maksā apmēram 0,05 - 0,2 ms uz aci."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kā DLAA apstrādā kustīgas daļas un kravas auto spoguļus. Pa labi atver grupu, pa kreisi aizver; "
"atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Dod katrai kustīgai daļai (satiksme, riteņi, numurzīmes) savu kustību DLAA, lai tā paliek asa un "
"neveido rēgus. Izslēdziet tikai, lai ietaupītu ~0,5 ms uz aci vai testam: tad katrs pikselis "
"kustas līdzi kamerai un satiksme izsmērējas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Dod kravas auto spoguļiem savu DLAA, lai tie nemirgotu. 1 spogulis = tikai lielākais (galvenais "
"spogulis blakus jums). visi = visi spoguļi. kamera = lētākais uz spoguli, kustīga satiksme var "
"veidot rēgus stiklā; citādi katra daļa stiklā kustas precīzi."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"ieslēgts = katrs spogulis saņem DLAA ik pēc 2. kadra un starplaikā rāda pēdējo tīro attēlu: "
"apmēram puse no spoguļu cenas. Malas paliek tīras; kustīgais stiklā atjaunojas uz pusi retāk. "
"izslēgts = katrs spogulis katrā kadrā."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Plānu vadu kustība saglabājas braucot: DLAA izplata kustības datus uz plānām līnijām (DLSS motion "
"dilation). ieslēgts = noklusējums. izslēgts = tikai salīdzināšanai; tuvie vadi vairāk mirgo. "
"Pārslēdzot attēls uz mirkli mīksts."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Plāni vadi saņem dziļumu katram skartajam pikselim, ne tikai tur, kur tie sedz pikseļa centru. "
"ieslēgts = noklusējums. ies. (no A2C) = arī caurspīdīgām malām. izslēgts = tikai salīdzināšanai; "
"tuvie vadi vairāk mirgo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentāls: tālus vadus, plānākus par 1 pikseli, zīmē kā 1 pikseļa līniju, lai tie nesaplīstu "
"svītrās. Pēc noklusējuma izslēgts: tāli vadi var izskatīties tumšāki vai vairāk mirgot. "
"Izmēģiniet un salīdziniet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"DLSS palielināšana, DLAA ieslēgšanas / izslēgšanas slēdzis un OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Pa "
"labi atver grupu, pa kreisi aizver; atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"DLSS uzzīmē attēlu atpakaļ pilnā izmērā, ja spēles Scaling ir zem 100 %: asāk nekā pašas spēles "
"stiepšana, un mazāk pikseļu nozīmē vairāk FPS. Papildu izmaksu nav; pie Scaling 100 % neko nedara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Ieslēdz vai izslēdz visu modifikāciju un atceras režīmu; off rāda pašas spēles attēlu "
"salīdzināšanai. Izslēgts ietaupa visu daļu cenu kopā."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR kadru ģenerēšana (djules75), atsevišķa lejupielāde "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). atrasts = tā slānis ir ielādēts šajā spēlē un modifikācija "
"ļauj tā darbam iet cauri. Palaidiet tā tray lietotni pirms spēles."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = OpenXR uzlabojumu komplekts (DienerTech) (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, kadru ģenerēšana; atrasts = tā slānis ir ielādēts spēlē un modifikācija ļauj tā darbam iet "
"cauri. Izmantojiet tikai vienu Turbo (tā vai modifikācijas)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"VR paātrinājumi: Turbo, foveated renderēšana un slēptās zonas maska. Pa labi atver grupu, pa "
"kreisi aizver; atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: bez ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojekcijas. Tikai VR. Ieslēgts = spēle negaida "
"austiņas katrā kadrā: vairāk FPS tikai tad, kad ierobežo CPU (pārpildītas pilsētas, satiksme). "
"Izslēdziet, ja attēls raustās. No OpenXR Toolkit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Ass centrs, mazāk detaļu malā (tikai NVIDIA RTX). Ietaupa GPU laiku pie liela Scaling. Tikai VR. "
"Ārējais gredzens tiek ēnots reizi uz 2 x 2 pikseļiem; žogi, zāle un lapas saglabā pilnu detaļu. "
"Izslēdziet, ja mala izskatās kvadrātaina."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Foveated (VRS) asā centra izmērs, 10 - 100 % ar soli 5 %: lielāks = vairāk attēla ass, mazāk "
"ietaupījuma; mazāks = vairāk ietaupījuma, zemākas detaļas sākas tuvāk vidum. 80 % (līdzsvarots) "
"ir noklusējums; 90 = plats, 65 = šaurs."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Kurus spēles piegājienus ietekmē Foveated (VRS). aina = tikai 3D pasaule (noklusējums). aina + "
"apgaismojums = arī apgaismojuma piegājiens, tikai pašā malā: vairāk ietaupījuma. Pārbaudiet: "
"meklējiet kvadrātainas gaismas vai ēnu malas redzes sānos."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Cik rupjš ir Foveated (VRS) ārējais gredzens. Parasts = 1 krāsa uz 2 x 2 pikseļiem (noklusējums). "
"Spēcīgs = uz 4 x 2, Maks. = uz 4 x 4: vairāk GPU ietaupījuma, kvadrātaināki stūri. Vislabāk ar "
"acu izsekošanu, kad uz ārējo gredzenu neskatāties."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentāls. Foveated (VRS) asais centrs seko acīm austiņās ar acu izsekošanu (OpenXR eye "
"gaze, piem. Varjo); bez tās paliek lēcas centrā. Vajag, lai Foveated (VRS) būtu ieslēgts spēles "
"sākumā, citādi restartējiet. Gandrīz bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR. Spēle izlaiž lēcu stūrus, ko neredzat (austiņas tos paziņo), tāpēc zīmē mazāk pikseļu: "
"vairāk GPU rezerves, redzamais attēls tāds pats. Pirmajai ieslēgšanai vajag restartēt spēli. "
"Izslēdziet, ja skata mala izskatās nepareizi."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kadru ātruma ierobežojumi un CPU: NVIDIA Reflex un FPS cap plakanam, VR FPS robeža, CPU regulēšana. Pa "
"labi atver grupu, pa kreisi aizver; atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Tikai plakans, tikai NVIDIA. Ieslēgts = spēles kadri GPU rindā gaida mazāk: mazāka ievades "
"aizture, kad ierobežo GPU. Boost arī notur GPU takts augstu. Tas pats FPS; maza cena. Netiek "
"lietots VR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Tikai plakans. Notur spēli ne augstāk par šo kadru ātrumu: vienmērīgs kadra laiks, mazāk siltuma "
"un enerģijas. Iestatiet nedaudz zem tā, ko jūsu PC notur pārpildītā pilsētā. Ar ieslēgtu Reflex "
"ierobežo NVIDIA draiveris. off = bez ierobežojuma."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR. half = spēle zīmē katru 2. austiņu kadru (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = katru 3.; austiņu "
"reprojekcija (ASW / Motion Smoothing) aizpilda pārējo vienmērīgā ritmā. Izmantojiet, kad FPS "
"svārstās. Ieslēdzot izslēdz Turbo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Trīs CPU slēdži kopā: galvenā un renderēšanas pavedieni dod priekšroku P-kodoliem (tikai Intel "
"hibrīda CPU), spēle darbojas ar Above normal prioritāti, un Windows nedrīkst to droselēt (EcoQoS) "
"vai ignorēt tās taimera pieprasījumus. Palīdz, kad ierobežo CPU; bez izmaksām. Atsevišķi "
"iestatījumi dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Paneļa pozīcija, izmērs, dziļums, virziens un izvēlnes taustiņi. Pa labi atver grupu, pa kreisi "
"aizver; atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR. Seko galvai = panelis kustas līdzi austiņām. Fiksēts kabīnē = paliek vienā vietā jūsu "
"sēdekļa priekšā, stabils, skatoties apkārt; X / Y / dziļums iestata šo vietu (grādi, metri). "
"Vajag VR slāni (noklusējums). Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pārvieto paneli uz sāniem, % no ekrāna (VR fiksēts kabīnē: grādi ap sēdekli). Plakanajam un VR ir "
"sava pozīcija. Izmantojiet, ja panelis aizsedz vajadzīgo. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pārvieto paneli uz augšu / leju, % no ekrāna (VR fiksēts kabīnē: grādi, plus = uz leju). "
"Plakanajam un VR ir sava pozīcija. Izmantojiet, ja panelis aizsedz vajadzīgo. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Padara paneli lielāku vai mazāku. Palieliniet, ja nevarat izlasīt, samaziniet, ja aizsedz par "
"daudz. Plakanajam un VR ir savs izmērs. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Cik tālu panelis peld: metros (0.30 - 3.00) kā VR slānis, "
"noklusējums; pikseļos uz iekšu uz aci, ja menu_vr_layer = 0. Tāds pats izmērs jebkurā dziļumā. "
"Mainiet, ja panelī skatīties nogurdina. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Ieslēgts = panelis pagriežas pret jums, kad to pārvietojat uz "
"sāniem, tāds pats izmērs no jebkura leņķa (kā VR slānis, noklusējums, arī galvai sekojošais fps "
"lodziņš); izslēgts = plakans attēls. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"Mazs tiešais fps un kadra laika lodziņš, arī kad šī izvēlne ir aizvērta (plakanais un VR). "
"Izmantojiet, lai redzētu, ko iestatījums dod. Tā GPU cena tiek mērīta: uz kadru, katrā attēlā, "
"kurā tas zīmēts; nekas, kad izslēgts. Save to saglabā nākamajai palaišanai."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"FPS lodziņa fiksācija, pozīcija, izmērs, krāsa, VR attālums un pagrieziens. Pa labi atver grupu, "
"pa kreisi aizver; atverot izvēlni, tā vienmēr ir aizvērta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR. Seko galvai = kustas līdzi austiņām. Fiksēts telpā = viena vieta ap sēdekli, ignorē "
"kabīnes šūpošanos. Pie transportlīdz. = pielipis pie kabīnes, šūpojas līdzi (vajag DLAA + Daļu "
"kustības vektorus). Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, Pie transportlīdz. Ieslēgts = katrs kravas auto / auto saglabā savu fps lodziņa vietu "
"kabīnē, pagriezienu, izmēru, krāsu, spilgtumu un tekstu (saglabājas dlaa.ini, aizverot izvēlni). "
"Izslēgts = viens kopīgs komplekts visiem transportlīdzekļiem. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, Pie transportlīdz. Pa labi = izmērīt kabīni vēlreiz (sēdiet mierīgi, stāvot), ja "
"lodziņš nav savā vietā. Pa kreisi = šī transportlīdzekļa lodziņš uz noklusējumiem (vieta, "
"pagrieziens, izmērs, krāsa, teksts); citi saglabā savus. Lodziņš ir taisns pret kabīni."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pārvieto fps lodziņu uz sāniem, % no ekrāna (VR fiksēts / pie: grādi ap jums). Plakanajam un VR "
"ir sava pozīcija. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pārvieto fps lodziņu uz augšu / leju, % no ekrāna (VR fiksēts / pie: grādi, mīnuss = uz augšu). "
"Plakanajam un VR ir sava pozīcija. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Pagriež fps lodziņu pa kreisi / pa labi, grādos (+ = seja "
"pagriežas pa labi). Izmantojiet lodziņa sasvēršanai, kad tas ir sānos. 0 = vērsts pret jums. Bez "
"izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Noliec fps lodziņu, grādos (+ = augšdaļa noliecas prom no jums, "
"it kā gulētu uz paneļa). 0 = vērsts pret jums. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Pagriež fps lodziņu savā plaknē, grādos (+ = pulksteņrādītāja "
"virzienā). 0 = taisni. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Padara fps lodziņu lielāku vai mazāku (0.2 .. 3.0). Palieliniet, ja nevarat izlasīt austiņās vai "
"lielā ekrānā. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS lodziņa teksta krāsa: 20 krāsas, katrai ar apmali, lai būtu salasāma uz jebkura attēla (melna "
"uz baltas = tumšs teksts, balta apmale). Plakanais un VR. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS lodziņa spilgtums, 10 - 100 %: 100 = krāsa kā ir, zemāks aptumšo tekstu (apmale paliek) uz "
"melnu. Izmantojiet skaitītāja pieklusināšanai naktī vai austiņās. Plakanais un VR. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Cik caurspīdīgs ir viss fps lodziņš, 10 - 100 %: 100 = necaurspīdīgs, zemāks izbalina tekstu UN "
"tā melno apmali kopā, lai aptumšots lodziņš nekļūtu par melnu plankumu. Plakanais un VR. Bez "
"izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Tikai VR, tāpēc plakanajā pelēks. Cik tālu fps lodziņš peld, 0.30 - 3.00 m. Tas saglabā to pašu "
"izmēru jūsu skatā jebkurā attālumā; mainās tikai dziļums. Novietojiet tuvu dziļumam, uz kuru "
"skatāties, lai lasītu bez pārfokusēšanas. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Kas tiek rakstīts dlaa_inject.log: off = nekas; errors = tikai kļūdas (noklusējums); warnings = + "
"apieti sarežģījumi; info = + palaišana un izmaiņas; debug = + statistika, un debug arī palaiž GPU "
"taimerus un CPU profilētāju."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Šīs izvēlnes valoda. auto = spēles valoda (noklusējums); pa kreisi / pa labi izvēlas citu. Linux "
"/ Proton: ķīniešu, japāņu un korejiešu valodai vajag fontus, skatiet README. Blakus DLL esošs "
"lang\\<code>.po uzvar, jūsu pašu labojumiem. Save to saglabā. Bez izmaksām."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Visi šīs izvēlnes karstie taustiņi, viena rinda uz darbību, ar tastatūras taustiņu un kontroliera "
"pogu. Pa labi atver sarakstu; ar labo izvēlieties darbību, tad nospiediet jaunu taustiņu vai "
"stūres pogu. Uzreiz saglabājas dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Ieraksta visu šeit redzamo dlaa.ini (iestatījumus un paneļa / fps lodziņa pozīcijas, kad esat tos "
"pārvietojuši), saglabājot visas pārējās rindas. Dariet to, kad patīk redzamais, citādi izmaiņas "
"pazudīs nākamajā palaišanā. Mode saglabājas pats."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Atiestata visus šīs izvēlnes iestatījumus uz modifikācijas piegādes stāvokli (modelis, asināšana, "
"tekstūru asums, DLAA zona, kustība, spoguļi, profils, panelis, fps lodziņš, turbo, foveated, "
"kadru ātrums, žurnāls), tieši un dlaa.ini, saglabājot jūsu karstos taustiņus un visas pārējās "
"rindas."

